title Mine Field: the screen gives other boards now (another density): the saved game is dropped, no loss, one line says so
sizes 800x480 480x800 640x480
ppmm 741
env MINEFIELD_TEST_DATA s-shape
env MINEFIELD_TEST_PROBES 1

wait 400
expect text "Saved game dropped: screen changed"
expect notext "Game resumed"
shot dropped
check dropped
wait 4000
expect notext "Saved game dropped: screen changed"
key m
wait 200
key down
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 300
shot stats-clean
expect text "Played"
